-Forget what?

262
00:22:16,679 --> 00:22:19,199
You're not supposed
to have any of those.

263
00:22:19,399 --> 00:22:22,639
-Yeah, I know.
-You have two now.

264
00:22:32,999 --> 00:22:34,519
Hey.

265
