Hey, Mom.

266
00:22:44,439 --> 00:22:48,319
One, two, three!

267
00:22:49,399 --> 00:22:52,519
-That's a basketball!
-Hey, hey. What do you mean?

268
00:22:52,719 --> 00:22:54,439
You don't know that
that's a basketball.

269
00:22:54,679 --> 00:22:58,559
This could be an ant farm. This could
be a microscope or anything.

270
00:22:58,759 --> 00:23:01,239
-No, it's not.
-There, there.

271
00:23:01,679 --> 00:23:04,719
All right, come on.
Open him up. Open him up.

272
00:23:10,599 --> 00:23:14,999
-That paper's a little heavy, huh?
-Yeah, but I got it.

273
00:23:26,239 --> 00:23:28,799
You should've seen me
out there today.

274
00:23:28,999 --> 00:23:31,519
Somebody stole a scanner.
I had to run the old girl down--

275
00:23:31,719 --> 00:23:33,319
Whatever.

276
00:23:34,919 --> 00:23:37,999
-What?
-Whatever, Chris.

277
00:23:38,559 --> 00:23:40,399
What the hell
you got attitude about?

278
00:23:40,599 --> 00:23:43,399
-"Whatever" what?
-Every day's got some damn story.

279
00:23:43,599 --> 00:23:44,959
Hey, Roy. Roy!

280
00:23:45,199 --> 00:23:47,479
Can you beat your little rug
when nobody's out here?

281
00:23:47,679 --> 00:23:49,119
There's dust and shit all over.

282
00:23:49,319 --> 00:23:51,719
