-Hey, wait a second.

283
00:23:51,919 --> 00:23:54,679
Look, Linda, relax.

284
00:23:54,879 --> 00:23:58,239
We're gonna come out of this.
Everything is gonna be fine, all right?

285
00:23:59,319 --> 00:24:03,239
You said that before,
when I got pregnant. "lt'll be fine."

286
00:24:03,439 --> 00:24:08,439
-So you don't trust me now?
-Whatever. I don't care.

287
00:24:23,599 --> 00:24:25,839
-Taxi!
-Mr. Twistle.

288
00:24:26,039 --> 00:24:28,719
-Yeah, hi.
-Hi. Chris Gardner.

289
00:24:28,919 --> 00:24:30,759
Yeah, hi. Listen.
What can I do for you?

290
00:24:30,959 --> 00:24:34,039
I submitted an application for the
intern program about a month ago...

291
00:24:34,239 --> 00:24:36,479
...and I would just love
to sit with you briefly--

292
00:24:36,679 --> 00:24:38,639
Listen, I'm going
to Noe Valley, Chris.

293
00:24:38,839 --> 00:24:42,119
-Take care of yourself.
-Mr. Twistle.

294
00:24:42,319 --> 00:24:44,719
Actually, I'm on my way
to Noe Valley also.

295
00:24:44,919 --> 00:24:46,639
How about we share a ride?

296
00:24:48,159 --> 00:24:50,319
-All right, get in.
-All right.

297
00:24:56,399 --> 00:24:59,159
So when I was in the Navy,
I worked for a doctor...

298
00:24:59,359 --> 00:25:02,199
...who loved to play golf,
hours every day...

299
00:25:02,399 --> 00:25:07,039
...and I would actually
perform medical procedures...

300
00:25:07,239 --> 00:25:08,799
...when he'd leave me in the office.

301
00:25:08,999 --> 00:25:14,279
So I'm used to being in a position
where I have to make decisions and....

302
00:25:15,719 --> 00:25:18,559
Mr. Twistle, listen.
This is a very important--

303
00:25:18,759 --> 00:25:20,959
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
This thing's impossible.

304
00:25:23,039 --> 00:25:25,159
-I can do it.
-No, you can't. No one can.

305
00:25:25,399 --> 00:25:28,039
-That's bullshit.
-No, I'm pretty sure I can do it.

306
00:25:28,519 --> 00:25:31,679
-No, you can't.
-Let me see it.

307
00:25:32,239 --> 00:25:33,479
Give it here.

308
00:25:36,439 --> 00:25:40,759
Oh, yeah. Oh, wow,
you really messed it up.

309
00:25:40,959 --> 00:25:42,479
Sorry.

310
00:25:43,039 --> 00:25:48,999
It looks like it works around a swivel,
so the center pieces never move.

311
00:25:49,199 --> 00:25:52,279
So if it's yellow in the center,
that's the yellow side.

312
00:25:52,519 --> 00:25:54,999
If it's red in the center,
that's the red side.

313
00:25:55,199 --> 00:25:58,839
-Okay.
-So.... You can slow down.

314
00:25:59,039 --> 00:26:02,119
Listen, we can drive around all day.
I don't believe you can do this.

315
00:26:02,319 --> 00:26:03,999
-Yeah, I can.
-No, you can't.

316
00:26:04,239 --> 00:26:05,399
-Yes, I can.
-No, you can't.

317
00:26:05,599 --> 00:26:07,519
I'm telling you, no one can.

318
00:26:09,439 --> 00:26:11,679
See? That's all I ever do.

319
00:26:24,559 --> 00:26:26,879
You almost have this side.

320
00:26:27,479 --> 00:26:28,959
Holy cow.

321
00:26:39,159 --> 00:26:42,959
-You almost had that one.
-I'm gonna get it.

322
00:26:50,519 --> 00:26:52,279
Look at that.

323
00:27:15,519 --> 00:27:16,759
You're almost there.

324
00:27:40,479 --> 00:27:44,199
-1 7.1 0.
-This is me.

325
00:27:46,319 --> 00:27:47,719
Good job.

326
00:27:49,519 --> 00:27:52,639
-Goodbye.
-Yeah. I'll see you soon.

327
00:27:55,079 --> 00:27:56,799
Where are you going, sir?

328
00:27:56,999 --> 00:27:59,999
Excuse me, sir.
Where are you going, please?

329
00:28:03,319 --> 00:28:05,079
Two-- A couple of blocks.

330
00:28:05,279 --> 00:28:08,679
-Just flip around.
-Okay.

331
00:28:50,599 --> 00:28:53,359
Hey! Stop it! Hey!

332
00:28:53,719 --> 00:28:55,279
-Where are you going? Come here!
-No!

333
00:28:55,479 --> 00:28:58,319
-No, no, no!
-You asshole, give me my money!

334
00:28:58,519 --> 00:28:59,839
-Give me my money.
-Please stop.

335
00:29:00,079 --> 00:29:02,039
-Please, please, please!
-Son of a bitch.

336
00:29:02,279 --> 00:29:04,839
Please! He should've paid you!

337
00:29:05,039 --> 00:29:06,559
-Come here!
-I'm sorry.

338
00:29:06,759 --> 00:29:08,479
-I'm so sorry.
-I'll kick your ass!

339
00:29:08,919 --> 00:29:12,119
-I'm sorry!
-ldiot.

340
00:29:22,919 --> 00:29:24,239
I'll get you!

341
00:29:24,439 --> 00:29:27,959
I'm going to kill you!
I'm going to kill you!

342
00:29:43,319 --> 00:29:45,439
Hey!

343
00:29:45,639 --> 00:29:48,559
Stop it, you son of a bitch!

344
00:29:48,799 --> 00:29:50,919
Stop him!

345
00:29:54,319 --> 00:29:56,839
Stop him!

346
00:30:02,079 --> 00:30:03,799
