347
00:30:03,999 --> 00:30:06,839
Please stand clear of the doors.

348
00:30:14,759 --> 00:30:17,879
No! No! No!

349
00:30:20,559 --> 00:30:22,359
No!

350
00:30:45,519 --> 00:30:47,919
-Hello?
-Hey, yeah.

351
00:30:48,119 --> 00:30:49,799
Sorry I couldn't
make it home on time.

352
00:30:49,999 --> 00:30:54,239
-Chris, I missed my shift.
-Yeah, I know. I'm sorry about that.

353
00:30:54,439 --> 00:30:57,759
Look, I'm on my way right now.
Are you all right with Christopher?

354
00:30:57,959 --> 00:31:00,319
I'm leaving. Chris, I'm leaving.

355
00:31:00,519 --> 00:31:02,519
-What?
-Did you hear what I said?

356
00:31:03,399 --> 00:31:07,319
I have my things together,
and I'm taking our son...

357
00:31:07,519 --> 00:31:09,039
...and we're gonna leave now.

358
00:31:09,439 --> 00:31:10,839
