445
00:37:34,839 --> 00:37:36,039
I got painters coming in.

446
00:37:36,239 --> 00:37:38,559
-All right, look. I need more time.
-No.

447
00:37:38,759 --> 00:37:40,879
All right, I'll paint it myself.

448
00:37:41,079 --> 00:37:46,439
All right, but I just-- I gotta have some
more time-- I got my son up in here.

449
00:37:51,279 --> 00:37:56,119
All right. One week.
And you paint it.

450
00:38:47,999 --> 00:38:49,639
Chris Gardner?

451
00:38:50,199 --> 00:38:52,959
Yeah. What happened?

452
00:38:53,159 --> 00:38:57,039
-Payable to the City of San Francisco.
-Does it have to be the full amount?

453
00:38:57,239 --> 00:39:00,719
You gotta pay each parking ticket,
otherwise, you're staying.

454
00:39:00,919 --> 00:39:02,399
This is all I got.

455
00:39:07,879 --> 00:39:10,559
You verify at 9:30
tomorrow morning.

456
00:39:11,119 --> 00:39:14,119
-What?
-You gotta stay until this thing clears.

457
00:39:16,319 --> 00:39:17,879
No.

458
00:39:18,079 --> 00:39:19,879
No, I can't spend the night here.

459
00:39:20,079 --> 00:39:22,679
-I have to pick up my son.
-You verify at 9:30 tomorrow.

460
00:39:22,879 --> 00:39:27,519
Sir, I have a job interview at Dean
Witter at 1 0:1 5 tomorrow morning.

461
00:39:27,719 --> 00:39:29,399
-I cannot stay--
-9:30 tomorrow morning.

462
00:39:29,639 --> 00:39:31,959
What am I supposed to do
with my son?

463
00:39:32,159 --> 00:39:34,639
-ls there anyone else who can--?
-I take care of him.

464
00:39:34,839 --> 00:39:37,839
Maybe we can go and have
Social Services pick him up.

465
00:39:41,919 --> 00:39:45,599
All right.
Can I have my phone call, please?

466
00:39:48,759 --> 00:39:51,039
-Hello.
-Hey.

467
00:39:51,239 --> 00:39:52,959
What do you want?

468
00:39:54,119 --> 00:39:58,759
You gotta get Christopher
from daycare. I can't.

469
00:39:59,919 --> 00:40:03,599
Just keep him for the night and I'm--
And-- Just one night.

470
00:40:03,799 --> 00:40:05,839
What happened?

471
00:40:06,079 --> 00:40:09,519
I'll pick him up
from daycare tomorrow.

472
00:40:09,719 --> 00:40:11,479
I'm gonna go right--
You can just--

473
00:40:11,719 --> 00:40:13,999
You can drop him off
and I'll pick him up.

474
00:40:14,319 --> 00:40:17,759
-No.
-Come on, Linda.

475
00:40:17,959 --> 00:40:22,239
-Why you doing that?
